WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:03.294
Mayor Bloom was still out of breath.

2
00:00:03.295 --> 00:00:06.730
Detective Smith got up from his desk so the mayor could sit down.

3
00:00:06.731 --> 00:00:09.765
"Tell me what happened, Mayor," the detective said.

4
00:00:09.766 --> 00:00:13.790
Mayor Bloom took a deep breath.

5
00:00:13.791 --> 00:00:15.910
"I was working in my office.

6
00:00:15.911 --> 00:00:20.543
Suddenly dozens of monkeys and apes stormed into the building.

7
00:00:20.544 --> 00:00:22.561
They were all wearing armor.

8
00:00:22.562 --> 00:00:26.376
They held spears, axes, and swords!

9
00:00:26.377 --> 00:00:32.554
One ape—perhaps a gibbon—said that Sun Wukong was now king of Metro City!

10
00:00:32.555 --> 00:00:39.159
Then Wukong walked in and sat at my desk!"

11
00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:43.784
"Nobody takes over our city!" Detective Smith rolled up his sleeves.

12
00:00:43.785 --> 00:00:47.386
"I'm going over there right now!"

13
00:00:47.387 --> 00:00:50.213
A huge wall now surrounded City Hall.

14
00:00:50.214 --> 00:00:55.912
Monkeys and apes, armed with weapons, stood along the wall.

15
00:00:55.913 --> 00:01:01.820
They looked dangerous.

16
00:01:01.821 --> 00:01:05.239
Detective Smith found a gate and knocked.

17
00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:09.205
The gate opened, and a gorilla stepped out.

18
00:01:09.206 --> 00:01:12.308
"What do you want?" the gorilla asked.

19
00:01:12.309 --> 00:01:17.762
Detective Smith cleared his throat. "I need to speak to Sun Wukong."

20
00:01:17.763 --> 00:01:23.391
The gorilla grunted. "Follow me."

21
00:01:23.392 --> 00:01:26.349
Soon Detective Smith stood in Mayor Bloom's office.

22
00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:30.042
Wukong sat at the desk while Bajie stood next to him.

23
00:01:30.043 --> 00:01:35.247
The gorilla snarled at the detective. "You're supposed to bow before the Monkey King!"

24
00:01:35.248 --> 00:01:40.807
"Are you kidding?" Detective Smith said. "Metro City doesn't have a king."

25
00:01:40.808 --> 00:01:43.754
The monkeys and apes gasped.

26
00:01:43.755 --> 00:01:46.383
"It's okay," Wukong said.

27
00:01:46.384 --> 00:01:49.369
"Detective Smith is new to having a king.

28
00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:53.118
He can be excused for not acting the right way."

29
00:01:53.119 --> 00:01:57.047
"Where did your army come from?" Detective Smith asked.

30
00:01:57.048 --> 00:02:00.479
"They came from the Fruit and Flower Mountain," Wukong said.

31
00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.382
"That's my other kingdom.

32
00:02:02.383 --> 00:02:05.178
And do you like the new wall I placed around this building?

33
00:02:05.179 --> 00:02:09.205
It's made from one of my hairs."

34
00:02:09.206 --> 00:02:14.054
Detective Smith narrowed his eyes. "You can't just take over this city!"

35
00:02:14.055 --> 00:02:18.013
Wukong shrugged. "Of course I can."

36
00:02:18.014 --> 00:02:28.462
Bajie stepped forward and smiled. "Guards! Put this man in jail!"

37
00:02:28.463 --> 00:02:33.563
"We will have a wonderful feast!" the Demon of Black Rain said.

38
00:02:33.564 --> 00:02:36.536
He was in the kitchen with his servants.

39
00:02:36.537 --> 00:02:41.615
Several demons chopped vegetables while others were busy grinding spices.

40
00:02:41.616 --> 00:02:44.798
Two demons prepared a large barrel of brine.

41
00:02:44.799 --> 00:02:51.264
"Master," one of the demons said. "We're going to pickle that purple monster."

42
00:02:51.265 --> 00:02:57.020
The demon patted his belly. "That sounds delicious!"

43
00:02:57.021 --> 00:02:59.858
Just then there was a knock at the cave's door.

44
00:02:59.859 --> 00:03:03.354
"Shall I answer that, Master?" a demon asked.

45
00:03:03.355 --> 00:03:07.352
"No, I'll answer it," the Demon of Black Rain said.

46
00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:13.606
"It might be that annoying goddess."

47
00:03:13.607 --> 00:03:16.733
The demon opened the door and saw the mountain's spirit.

48
00:03:16.734 --> 00:03:21.912
"Oh, it's you," he said. "What do you want?"

49
00:03:21.913 --> 00:03:31.455
"Please, let me in," the spirit said. "I have important information for you."

50
00:03:31.456 --> 00:03:37.374
The demon let her in.

51
00:03:37.375 --> 00:03:42.173
He poked his head out, looked both ways, and then slammed the door shut.

52
00:03:42.174 --> 00:03:47.486
The lock clicked. "Well, what do you have to tell me?"

53
00:03:47.487 --> 00:03:49.364
The spirit looked worried.

54
00:03:49.365 --> 00:03:56.558
"I was just talking to a goddess. She's really mad at you."

55
00:03:56.559 --> 00:04:00.125
The demon shrugged. "So what?"

56
00:04:00.126 --> 00:04:05.942
"She told me she's going to come up here," the spirit said.

57
00:04:05.943 --> 00:04:10.369
"She plans to rescue the Tang Monk!"

58
00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:19.920
"Oh yeah?" The demon narrowed his eyes. "I'll be ready for her!"

